                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 3976,
                            "last_played": 1792807891
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Even though I recommend it, there are much better titles out there. The first few hours are definitely a struggle because you have a very limited moveset and bosses hit pretty hard even on normal so I found my self having to resurrect myself multiple times during a boss fight which kinda breaks the flow of the fight. But steadily towards mid game you become pretty decent with upgrades and boss fights get managable. However during the last stages of the game, they just throw mid-boss after mid-boss in every room of the dungeon and I just wanted to get the game done with (60hr mark) and played through the last dungeon on Story mode. \r\nIts definitely a beautiful game. The characters were memorable and each had their own fleshed out story arc and the music was phenomenal. The anime sequences from time to time were also amazing.\r\nOverall, I enjoyed the story but the battle part of it brought down the score for me. 7.5/10 experience.",
